<style>
  .org-panel {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    left: 24px;
    z-index: 100;
    width: 320px;
    max-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
    overflow-y: auto;
    padding: 20px 22px;
    color: #d8dcec;
    background: rgba(11, 14, 26, 0.84);
    border: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.18);
    border-radius: 4px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace;
  }
  .org-title {
    margin: 0 0 2px 0;
    font-family: Palatino, "Iowan Old Style", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: #e8e4d4;
  }
  .org-subtitle {
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #8890a8;
  }
  .org-label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin: 10px 0 4px 0;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #a8a090;
  }
  .org-label span:last-child {
    color: #e8e4d4;
  }
  .org-panel input[type="range"] {
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0 0 6px 0;
    accent-color: #e8a33d;
  }
  .org-btn-group {
    display: flex;
    gap: 4px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .org-btn {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    padding: 5px 8px;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: #d8dcec;
    background: rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.18);
    border-radius: 3px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.15s, border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .org-btn:hover {
    background: rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.14);
  }
  .org-btn-active {
    color: #0b0e1a;
    background: #e8a33d;
    border-color: #e8a33d;
  }
  .org-play {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
  #org-stats {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.14);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #9aa2b8;
  }
  .org-stat {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .org-stat-swatch {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .org-stat-value {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: #e8e4d4;
  }
  .org-hypothesis {
    margin: 12px 0 0 0;
    padding-top: 10px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(216, 210, 192, 0.14);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #8890a8;
  }
  .org-hypothesis strong {
    color: #c8ccdc;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .org-hint {
    margin: 10px 0 0 0;
    font-size: 10px;
    color: #6a7288;
  }
</style>

<div
  id="org-container"
  style="width: 100%; height: 100vh; background: #0b0e1a;">
</div>

<div
  class="org-panel">
  <h3
    class="org-title">
    Org Topology
  </h3>
  <p
    class="org-subtitle">
    One organization as a cone.
    Leadership at the center, user-facing staff at the edge, administration between.
    Height is hierarchy: a flatter org is a shorter one.
  </p>

  <div
    class="org-label">
    <span>
      Size
    </span>
  </div>
  <div
    id="org-size"
    class="org-btn-group">
    <button
      class="org-btn"
      data-size="small">
      Small · 1–10
    </button>
    <button
      class="org-btn"
      data-size="medium">
      Medium · &lt;100
    </button>
    <button
      class="org-btn"
      data-size="large">
      Large · 100s
    </button>
    <button
      class="org-btn"
      data-size="xl">
      XL · 2000+
    </button>
  </div>

  <label
    class="org-label"
    for="org-ai">
    <span>
      AI automation
    </span>
    <span
      id="org-ai-value">
    </span>
  </label>
  <input
    type="range"
    id="org-ai"
    min="0"
    max="100"
    value="0" />

  <div
    class="org-label">
    <span>
      Headcount strategy
    </span>
  </div>
  <div
    id="org-strategy"
    class="org-btn-group">
    <button
      class="org-btn"
      data-strategy="reallocate">
      Reallocate · stable headcount
    </button>
    <button
      class="org-btn"
      data-strategy="reduce">
      Reduce · shrink
    </button>
  </div>

  <label
    class="org-label"
    for="org-meaningful">
    <span>
      Meaningful work identifiable
    </span>
    <span
      id="org-meaningful-value">
    </span>
  </label>
  <input
    type="range"
    id="org-meaningful"
    min="0"
    max="100"
    value="70" />

  <button
    id="org-play"
    class="org-btn org-play">
    Play AI adoption
  </button>

  <div
    id="org-stats">
  </div>

  <p
    class="org-hypothesis">
    <strong>Hypothesis.</strong>
    As AI absorbs administrative work the org flattens and the middle band thins.
    New kinds of work emerge.
    Human-to-human contact thickens at the edge while human-to-AI contact thickens in administration.
    Keeping headcount stable is viable only to the extent meaningful work can be identified; the rest shows up as unassigned.
  </p>
  <p
    class="org-hint">
    Drag to orbit, scroll to zoom.
    Dots keep their identity as they move between roles.
  </p>
</div>

<script>
  window.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
    window.org = window.orgTopology();
  });
</script>
